      ":question/difficulty": {
        ":db/ident": ":question.difficulty/moderate"
      },
      ":question/id": "1fe16984-8dc7-561a-bb43-80bc768dbed2",
      ":question/problem": "Without using a calculator, find the exact value of\n$$\n4\\,\\sin\\left(67.5^\\circ\\right)\\cos\\left(67.5^\\circ\\right)\\cos\\left(135^\\circ\\right).\n$$",
      ":question/retired": true,
      ":question/worked-solution": "Let $E$ denote the given expression. Use $\\sin x\\cos x=\\frac{1}{2}\\sin(2x)$ first at $x=67.5^\\circ$ and then at $x=135^\\circ$. Each application introduces a factor of $\\frac{1}{2}$.\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\nE&=2\\,\\sin\\left(135^\\circ\\right)\\cos\\left(135^\\circ\\right)\\\\&=\\sin\\left(270^\\circ\\right)\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\nThe terminal sine is $\\sin\\left(270^\\circ\\right)=-1$.\nTherefore,\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\nE&=\\left(-1\\right)\\\\&=-1.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$"
    },
    {
      ":db/id": 17592186696420,
      ":question/answer-fields": [
        {
