      ":question/id": "5f5f9ddc-cee0-5b98-973b-5ba53e1662a7",
      ":question/problem": "Without using a calculator, find the exact value of\n$$\n4\\,\\sin\\left(37.5^\\circ\\right)\\cos\\left(37.5^\\circ\\right)\\cos\\left(75^\\circ\\right).\n$$",
      ":question/retired": true,
      ":question/worked-solution": "Let $E$ denote the given expression. Use $\\sin x\\cos x=\\frac{1}{2}\\sin(2x)$ first at $x=37.5^\\circ$ and then at $x=75^\\circ$. Each application introduces a factor of $\\frac{1}{2}$.\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\nE&=2\\,\\sin\\left(75^\\circ\\right)\\cos\\left(75^\\circ\\right)\\\\&=\\sin\\left(150^\\circ\\right)\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\nThe terminal sine is $\\sin\\left(150^\\circ\\right)=\\frac{1}{2}$.\nTherefore,\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\nE&=\\left(\\frac{1}{2}\\right)\\\\&=\\frac{1}{2}.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$"
    },
