      ":question/difficulty": {
        ":db/ident": ":question.difficulty/easy"
      },
      ":question/id": "0b13d522-9f37-55f4-abb4-03939cf0584e",
      ":question/problem": "Without using a calculator, find the exact value of\n$$\n8\\,\\sin\\left(7.5^\\circ\\right)\\cos\\left(7.5^\\circ\\right)\\cos\\left(15^\\circ\\right).\n$$",
      ":question/worked-solution": "Let $E$ denote the given expression. Use $\\sin x\\cos x=\\frac{1}{2}\\sin(2x)$ first at $x=7.5^\\circ$ and then at $x=15^\\circ$. Each application introduces a factor of $\\frac{1}{2}$.\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\nE&=4\\,\\sin\\left(15^\\circ\\right)\\cos\\left(15^\\circ\\right)\\\\&=2\\,\\sin\\left(30^\\circ\\right)\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\nThe terminal sine is $\\sin\\left(30^\\circ\\right)=\\frac{1}{2}$.\nTherefore,\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\nE&=2\\,\\left(\\frac{1}{2}\\right)\\\\&=1.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$"
    },
